notes.content:
The Particle of God development team wishes you a Happy New Year 2024 and Merry Christmas. 

Major updates:
We did a lot of work with the lighting;
Added sand and fog effects;
Improved graphics on locations;
Dozens of new quests for various factions have been registered;
The visual part of the control panel has been replaced.

Updated the demo version, took into account requests and wishes:

Translated into languages such as English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Chinese, Portuguese, Japanese, Russian;
Added hints, interface training;
Optimized the lighting in the initial location, the cave;
Fixed bugs with tasks from the Buddha character;
Fixed bugs with sound;
Changes have been made to the control panel;
Improved the combat system;
Made the Esc button active to open the menu;
Made corrections to the navigation and movement of characters.
